{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/Wishlist.gif?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/brandingBanner.png?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Success starts with a name! Cargo Simulator allows you to create and grow your own brand - give your warehouse a name, boost your reputation and make a difference in the logistics world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start from scratch and become the region's most powerful logistics center!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/Branding.gif?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/warehousManagementBanner.png?t=1747343186\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The warehouse is not just a workplace, it is a reflection of you. It's up to you to personalize your warehouse for a better working environment. Whether you want to create a modern center or a cozy family business - the choice is yours!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/WarehouseManagement.gif?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/growBanner.png?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start small, dream big! Deliver cargo on time, increase customer satisfaction and have a larger logistics network.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/Grow.gif?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/NewpackagingBanner.png?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The right package is essential for a successful delivery! Choose the most suitable shipping box according to the size, shape and sensitivity of the incoming products. Happy customers and fast growth are waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/sahne1Gif.gif?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/NewdeliverBanner__1_.png?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speed is everything! Get packages to customers all over the city on time. Carry more cargo with different vehicles and deliver faster. Every delivery is an opportunity to grow your brand! Every box is a part of your success!\u201cHeavy traffic, narrow streets... Each delivery has its own story!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/Delivering.gif?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/agreementsBanner.png?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Big business thrives on strong partnerships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every successful delivery opens the door to new vehicles, warehouse upgrades and bigger deals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your delivery network and climb to the top of the industry by contracting with major logistics companies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/Aggrements.gif?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/EntertainmentBanner.png?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work is not just work! Between deliveries, explore the city's entertainment areas and recharge your batteries.A world of work and pleasure awaits you in Cargo Simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573430?t=1747343186","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573430?t=1747343186","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/a0029a130b51ecffa29b5a9da9e47659b17eebda/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747343186","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/a0029a130b51ecffa29b5a9da9e47659b17eebda/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747343186","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/Wishlist.gif?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_pa