!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your delivery network and climb to the top of the industry by contracting with major logistics companies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/Aggrements.gif?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/EntertainmentBanner.png?t=1747343186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work is not just work! Between deliveries, explore the city's entertainment areas and recharge your batteries.A world of work and pleasure awaits you in Cargo Simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","developers":["Sincapp Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/6eb9482a4a07475c2a884c9879ecb72a0eaaf459/header.jpg?t=1747343186","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257139635,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139635/movie480.mp4?t=1747234077","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139635/movie_max.mp4?t=1747234077"},"name":"Cargo Simulator | Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257139635/fd94acb624d7d39f2b9ff7ca1eb76d6e9d4ce076/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747234077","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139635/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747234077","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139635/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747234077"}}],"name":"Cargo Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows (64-bit) 10<